{"id":"68f94e167b","t":"A Corporate Underling Who Excels at Work","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/korporativnyi-autsaider-1-193x278.webp","n":49,"l":49,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work"},"u":1795038734510,"desc":"“تشاي كيونغ جون”، الذي عاش متخلياً عن دراسته الجامعية وأحلامه بسبب أزمة صندوق النقد الدولي (IMF)، يجد نفسه محبطاً وغارقاً في اليأس مرة أخرى أمام فواتير المستشفى لجدته التي انهارت مريضة فجأة. ولكن، يظهر “صاحب الظل الطويل” (فاعل خير سري) ليتكفل بمصاريف المستشفى لعائلة كيونغ جون… “من يقدم دعماً كهذا لا يعود عليه بأي نفع، ولماذا؟” من أجل العثور على الإجابة، يتجه كيونغ جون إلى شركة “تاي سونغ”..","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اعمار","اعمال","اقتصاد","تجاره","دراما"],"src":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work|/manga/a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work/1/"},"2":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work|/manga/a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work/2/"},"3":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work|/manga/a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work/3/"},"4":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work|/manga/a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work/4/"},"5":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work|/manga/a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work/5/"},"6":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work|/manga/a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work/6/"},"7":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work|/manga/a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work/7/"},"8":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work|/manga/a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work/8/"},"9":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work|/manga/a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work/9/"},"10":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work|/manga/a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work/10/"},"11":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work|/manga/a-corporate-underling-who-excels-at-work/11/"},"12":{"ml":"a-corporate-underling-who-ex